  m_text: 'Health Item Density: Health items spawn faster and the item cap increases.

    Increase
    Health: Increase max health and restore the same amount immediately.

    Tilt
    Boost: Increase boosted tilt angle and lift impulse.

    Push Cooldown: Reduce
    the push ability cooldown.

    Push Power: Increase the impulse applied by the
    push ability.

    Push Range: Increases the radius of push force field.

    Catch
    Breath: Pause enemy for several seconds.

    Luck: Boost drops of health and
    increases damage damp when touched with enemy.

'
